# SC -- PAW setup ("NDLSS" augmentation), PRB2017-style generic recipe
# Source: element/variant structure (NPRO, ID, ZV) from Peter Bloechl's CP-PAW
#   Element0ktest benchmark species list
#   (CP-PAW: src/Benchmarks/Element0ktest/src/specieslist);
#   the RCL/RCOV, CORE POW, LRHOX and RAD/RCOV values below instead follow
#   the general-purpose "house" ratios seen directly in Peter's own real,
#   published production setups for H/Li/O/Mn in
#   Bloechl group, PBE0r paper, Phys. Rev. B 95, 235150 (2017)
#   (RBOX/RCOV=1.2, RCSM/RCOV=0.25 already matched Element0ktest; RCL/RCOV,
#   CORE POW, and LRHOX did not -- see the dev notes for the
#   comparison that motivated this switch).
# CAVEAT: this element itself was NOT one of the ones validated in the
#   paper -- only the generic ratios are paper-derived, this specific
#   element/variant combination still needs its own GHOSTBUSTER/EPWPSI/
#   equilibrium-volume check before production use. No !NTBO (onsite-
#   hybrid) block is included here (only known for H/Li/O/Mn).
# Variant selected: semicore (_SC) -- see ../VASP_VARIANT_MAPPING.md
#   (best-effort, not independently verified -- see the Li correction noted
#   there and in the dev notes).
#
  !SPECIES NAME='SC' NPRO=2 2 1 LRHOX=4 RAD/RCOV=1.2
    !AUGMENT ID='SC_NDLSS_SC_V0' EL='SC' ZV=11. TYPE='NDLSS'
             RBOX/RCOV=1.2 RCSM/RCOV=0.25
             RCL/RCOV=0.7 0.7 0.7 0.7
      !GRID DMIN=1.E-6 DMAX=0.1 RMAX=10. !END
      !POT  POW=3. RC/RCOV=0.7 !END
      !CORE POW=2. RC/RCOV=0.7 !END
    !END
  !END
